# Free API keys — .env.example

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in YOUR OWN keys (obtained from the
official free tiers listed in `docs/10-free-tools-and-apis.md`).
**Never commit the filled `.env`** — it is gitignored. Treat keys like
passwords; GitHub scans for and revokes leaked keys.

```bash
# Google AI Studio (Gemini) — free tier: https://aistudio.google.com
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Mistral — free tier: https://console.mistral.ai
MISTRAL_API_KEY=

# Groq — free tier: https://console.groq.com
GROQ_API_KEY=

# Hugging Face — free token: https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
HF_TOKEN=

# ChemSpider (RSC) — free registration: https://developer.rsc.org
CHEMSPIDER_TOKEN=

# CORE (open-access literature) — free tier: https://core.ac.uk/services/api
CORE_API_KEY=

# CrossRef / OpenAlex — no key needed; add your e-mail to the polite pool:
CROSSREF_MAILTO=your.name@example.com
```
